name: Erratic Two Spike — many 2s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Twos, a 25% rank spike for Wee Joker,
  Hack, Fibonacci, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic twos, many 2s,
  low-card pile, Wee Joker seed, funny tiny card build.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Two
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: WeeJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Fibonacci
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Two density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
